  "details": "With one controller connected, the other hand is always stuck in open palm. A way to fix this is a menu of guesture toggles\n\nIn my example images, you go to tools, select guestures, select the hand you want, and select the guesture you want. When no guestures are selected, it sets the hand to no guesture\n\nThis could be helpful to people with a broken or dysfunctional controller (like me)",
